  "description": "Items scrolling, page jumps, category-to-list reset, empty lists and category navigation boundaries.",
  "registration": "Rust inventory-fixture grants 41 distinct consumable IDs to copies of the Items handoff fixture. Native update 64 is source VI zero; field and UI origins retain their independently observed values. The replay checks continuous rows in both directions, ignored input during scrolling, full-page jumps and bounds, category-to-list cursor resets, empty lists, and ignored shoulder buttons while category tabs have focus. Every captured pose uses unchanged tolerance 8/1%, alongside menu, party and field state. Source scroll counters are observed after drawing, so the state gate advances the native rendered pose once for that observation. VIs 493, 496, 499, 502 have no recorded video presentation and are omitted based on ffprobe timestamps. Five selected poses also compare tight upper/lower arrow regions so misplaced or missing arrows cannot hide inside the whole-frame allowance.",
